<item>
            <title>[IGNITE-10432] regression on sqlline </title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-10432</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;I&apos;ve tried to execute our example using sqlline and got the following error:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;code panel&quot; style=&quot;border-width: 1px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;codeContent panelContent&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;code-java&quot;&gt;
2787/5325    INSERT INTO City(ID, Name, CountryCode, District, Population) VALUES (2769,&lt;span class=&quot;code-quote&quot;&gt;&apos;Sokoto&apos;&lt;/span&gt;,&lt;span class=&quot;code-quote&quot;&gt;&apos;NGA&apos;&lt;/span&gt;,&lt;span class=&quot;code-quote&quot;&gt;&apos;Sokoto &amp;amp; Kebbi &amp;amp; Zam&apos;&lt;/span&gt;,204900);
Error: Value &lt;span class=&quot;code-keyword&quot;&gt;for&lt;/span&gt; a column &lt;span class=&quot;code-quote&quot;&gt;&apos;DISTRICT&apos;&lt;/span&gt; is too &lt;span class=&quot;code-object&quot;&gt;long&lt;/span&gt;. Maximum length: 20, actual length: 21 (state=23000,code=4008)
Aborting command set because &lt;span class=&quot;code-quote&quot;&gt;&quot;force&quot;&lt;/span&gt; is &lt;span class=&quot;code-keyword&quot;&gt;false&lt;/span&gt; and command failed: &lt;span class=&quot;code-quote&quot;&gt;&quot;INSERT INTO City(ID, Name, CountryCode, District, Population) VALUES (2769,&lt;span class=&quot;code-quote&quot;&gt;&apos;Sokoto&apos;&lt;/span&gt;,&lt;span class=&quot;code-quote&quot;&gt;&apos;NGA&apos;&lt;/span&gt;,&lt;span class=&quot;code-quote&quot;&gt;&apos;Sokoto &amp;amp; Kebbi &amp;amp; Zam&apos;&lt;/span&gt;,204900);&quot;&lt;/span&gt;
0: jdbc:ignite:thin:&lt;span class=&quot;code-comment&quot;&gt;//127.0.0.1:10800&amp;gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;p&gt;To reproduce:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ol&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;start one ignite node (version 2.7)&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;start sqlline (sqlline.bat -u jdbc:ignite:thin://127.0.0.1:10800)&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;execute in sqlline the command: !run ../examples/sql/world.sql&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;


&lt;p&gt;The same on 2.6 or 2.5 worked w\o error.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
